liation log; Comparative Excel dashboard with filters; Qualified analytical findings and source-backed handover. Associated capability evidence: CAP01 Investigation brief; CAP02 Stakeholder and site register; CAP05 Laboratory comparison sheet; CAP06 Validated analytical workbook; CAP07 Evidence and hypothesis matrix; CAP08 Criteria comparison and gap report; CAP11 Final professional investigation portfolio.", "primary_riasec": "I", "secondary_riasec": "C", "tertiary_riasec": "R", "riasec_reason": "ICR (Investigative/Conventional/Realistic): I supports investigating anomalies; C supports accurate datasets and repeatable formulas; R reflects the use of quantitative monitoring instruments and evidence. Proposed role-environment orientation, not an individual assessment.", "degree_gate": "Preferred", "direct_degree_mapping": "B.Sc. Environmental Science; B.Sc. Biotechnology; B.Sc. Geography; B.Sc. Geology; B.Tech Computer Science Engineering; B.Tech Information Technology; BCA; MCA; B.Sc. Statistics; B.Sc. Mathematics; B.Sc. Data Science; B.Sc. Artificial Intelligence; Geoinformatics / Remote Sensing; Public Health programmes", "apt_verbal_reasoning": 70, "apt_logical_reasoning": 92, "apt_numerical_reasoning": 94, "apt_data_interpretation": 96, "apt_pattern_recognition": 90, "apt_spatial_reasoning": 65, "big5_openness": 5, "big5_conscientiousness": 5, "big5_extraversion": 2, "big5_agreeableness": 3, "big5_emotional_stability": 4, "value_impact": 5, "value_status": 3, "value_autonomy": 4, "value_security": 4, "value_financial": 4, "value_lifestyle": 4, "value_creativity": 5, "value_leadership": 3, "aptitude_areas": "Data Interpretation|Logical Reasoning|Numerical Reasoning", "aptitude_rationale": "Exact-key joins, calculations, charts and QA checks require strong numeric and data reasoning. These are draft importance estimates for role requirements, not learner aptitude scores; SME review required.", "big_five_traits": "Conscientiousness|Openness|Emotional Stability", "b